{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-16T12:49:56.765Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d033c4d1e8d3b585e37f1a2","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-16T12:49:56.765Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Inspection correction: viewers of one project already share one subscription (getActiveProjectIds plus the reconciler map); the 250 ms loop is per active project, not per viewer. Each idle loop calls listMutationEvents and therefore takes the SDK index lock. The pinned SDK has no public cheap generation marker. Test-only IPC now counts successful index-lock payload writes; idle observations occur after the production filesystem baseline with zero writers, followed by the unchanged traced 100-subscriber mixed-writer workload. Host load is currently elevated; record load and short CPU samples and avoid overlapping our own experiments."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-16T12:49:56.765Z"}],"before_hash":"d3f5149a8d7426899320c13c085d8ff85b6ae0a0654cdb814c70363765e3351b","after_hash":"d57f060972904eeccfe3e049f8c703a3662b318a1b515fdf4f11268aa317efe5","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"0c220992a856957f11b864b364db329fdac55d33ee443850589987293895aaa7"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-16T12:55:42.701Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"9d033c4d1e8d3b585e37f1a2","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-16T12:55:42.700Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Matched traced baseline at 100 subscribers, 10 lanes and 50 writes, three serial runs: idle locks/sec 3.410 / 3.494 / 3.494; to-all p99 2335.1 / 1605.0 / 2105.2 ms; CLI pre-append p99 405.5 / 1039.3 / 1815.2 ms; HTTP pre-append p99 798.7 / 377.3 / 1007.4 ms. Every run committed 50/50 updates with zero missing or duplicate receipts. Shared-host initial loads 6.83 / 12.28 / 13.29 exceed four CPUs, so quiet-host timing is NOT established. Design: exact history-stream plus index/WAL stat tokens (size, mtimeNs, ctimeNs, inode, device), project-scoped signals, identical-query single-flight and a five-second full check. Replay floor derives from the prior completed scan before pruning, protecting near-expiry facts after skipped polls. SDK fallback and pagination remain delegated to listMutationEvents; SDK pin and subscriber authorization are unchanged."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-16T12:55:42.701Z"}],"before_hash":"d57f060972904eeccfe3e049f8c703a3662b318a1b515fdf4f11268aa317efe5","after_hash":"902411836106ddb54dd467762ef3d5c5db98df12666505ff7eef91ff8e41c774","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive"